; One diagnostic, on the child that crosses the ceiling — the line to
; delete — not on the parent. Its path is that child's own positional
; step, which for a form child is its head.
;
; One report per crossing, too, not one per child past the ceiling: the
; emit fires on the transition from `max` to `max + 1`, so a form five
; children over its bound still reports once, naming the real count.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code positional_too_many :severity err :path [render-pipeline fragment]))
